From 6aeec8b08bdf48efbe317f6f0a1422e39ca75399 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: c4ffein <c4ffein.work@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 16:24:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] Add cloud accounts, Tinygrad codegen, and dark-theme the
 D3 canvas

Integrated from three subagent branches (merged clean) + one integration fix.

- Cloud save/accounts (progressive enhancement; works logged-out): src/lib/Backend/apiClient.js +
  src/components/Account/AccountPanel.vue talk to the separate Django Ninja backend (auth + /api/projects).
  Cloud save/load round-trips through the SAME toJSON/loadJSON the File menu uses, via new
  D3Interface.getGraphJSON()/loadGraphFromJSON(). New File>Save to cloud / Open from cloud + Account menu.
  17 apiClient unit tests + cloud.spec.js e2e (backend mocked).
- Tinygrad code generation: src/lib/KerasInterface/KerasGeneratorTinygradHelper.js mirrors the PyTorch
  helper (nn.Linear/Conv2d/BatchNorm2d modules, activations as Tensor methods x.relu()/x.flatten(1)),
  unsupported layers -> explicit # TODO; Generate Tinygrad File-menu item. 8 exact-string unit tests.
- Dark-theme the D3 canvas: canvas tokens in App.vue (light values unchanged), WhiteBoard CSS + arrow
  markers + drag-preview now follow the theme so the board/nodes/edges re-skin on toggle.

Integration fix: a11y.spec.js now matches the File menu "Save" item with exact:true, since h1 added a
"Save to cloud" item that made the substring name ambiguous.

Verified together: lint 0/0, 162 unit tests (12 files), build ok, non-network e2e 61/61
(app/interactions/help/tutorial/a11y/dataset-error/cloud + 32 core-features). Cloud UI verified
against a mocked backend; the real backend (nnvp-backend) has its own 12 passing tests.

